WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:04.190
<i>Due to the power of the Crest,
 Yuma not only has lost his 'Bring it to 'Em',</i>

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:08.470
<i>but also his fighting spirit and challenger's determination to never give up!</i>

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.800
<i>Yuma, please believe in your power!</i>

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.520
<i>Believe in your bond with your friends!</i>

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.450
Yuma...

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.140
Yuma!!

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.230
You don't even have any strength left for battle, Yuma?

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.790
So... so scary...

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.260
So scary...!

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.080
I set one card, and end my turn!

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:47.100
Come, come at me with all you've got, Yuma!

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.650
No... I don't wanna!

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.910
Why should I have to battle with those monsters anyway?

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.450
What just happened?

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.140
Something is strange...

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.320
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.020
What are you doing? It's your turn!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.600
Hey, Yuma, draw your card! Hurry up and draw your card!

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.200
My... my turn...

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:15.070
Draw.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:18.140
I...

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:19.980
I...

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:21.750
I...

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:22.930
The duel...

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.280
I'll... surrender the duel.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:33.210
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:36.260
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:43.520
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:52.780
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:57.280
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:03.740
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:08.540
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:14.210
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:19.470
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:22.350
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.640
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:30.810
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.400
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.570
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:42.120
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.620
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:47.620
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:54.420
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:07.620
"Number 48: Yuma Gives Up!?
 The Stolen "Bring It To 'Em!""

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.620
I can't believe you would act this cowardly after losing your 'Bring it to 'Em'!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.580
Huh? The 'Bring it to 'Em'?

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:10.870
What's going on here?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.920
Yuma's 'Bring it to 'Em' and Astral were all sealed.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.460
See for yourself!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.390
Astral?!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.310
He's really over there right now!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:32.310
Yuma only has dread left, after losing the 'Bring it to 'Em' and Astral.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:33.940
No way!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.860
That's dirty, you jerk!

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.030
That's right, that's right!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.440
That's just too much!

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.280
Say what you like!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.080
Yuma, unfortunately I won't acknowledge your surrender!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:49.620
I will defeat you for good, and seize everything from you!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.750
How...how could that be?

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:55.080
Don't worry, I shall redeem you soon enough.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.420
Prepare yourself, Yuma Tsukumo! You will lose here and now!

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.220
My turn, draw!

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.470
Shoot!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.260
It's alright! Yuma still has Gogogo Golem!

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.430
I am not that naive!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:13.230
I summon OOParts Monster Mud Golem Shakouki!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.860
You mean Gogogo Golem in defense position won't be destroyed by battle?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.240
But that's meaningless for me!

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:30.500
Go, Mud Golem Shakouki! Attack Gogogo Golem!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.830
Jomon Laser!!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:41.590
When this monster attacks a monster in Defense Position, it will inflict piercing damage to the player!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.890
Then I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Heart of Stone!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.480
When an OOParts Monster fails to destroy a monster my opponent controls by battle,

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.610
This card allows that monster to attack once again!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:05.240
Mud Golem Shakouki, crush Gogogo Golem!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.490
Jomon Laser!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.380
Yuma!!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.550
Now there is nothing left to defend you.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.460
It's over, Yuma!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.630
Go, Machu Mach!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.220
Fire of Vril!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.520
If he takes that face-on, to summarize, he will be finished!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.110
Yuma!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.240
This is... the last of...

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.450
...my strength!

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.160
Remember it!!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.240
Bring it to 'Em!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:01.670
What...what's this?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:11.930
This card...

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.060
I special summon Gagaga Gardna!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:22.610
What?!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.320
That's right, Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:29.740
Gagaga Gardna can be special summoned from the hand when the player was attacked directly!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.040
Yu...Yuma!!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.960
Impossible... Why?!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.130
Right, it must be Astral!

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.340
Astral, how dare you obstruct me!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.900
Astral is...!

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.370
Just disappear!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:22.670
Yuma! Don't give up!!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.140
What's... this?

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.770
Astral!!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.780
Now no one will be able to save you.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.030
Yuma!

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.030
Please calm yourself!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:02.830
To summarize, this is AR space. Even if Yuma-<i>kun</i> were to fall by some chance...

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:07.040
What are you talking about? 
Did you forget <i>where</i> we are right now?!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.710
That's right! We are...

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.810
... on the freeway that was built above the sea!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.060
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.440
Yuma, get a hold of yourself!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.980
Why? You guys...

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.450
Isn't that obvious? We're friends!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:37.660
Me...and you guys...are friends?

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.080
That's right!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.160
Yuma...

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.660
We are...

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.040
...friends!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.050
Hey, did you forget everything?

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.260
Aren't you a guy who never gives up?

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.930
Regardless of the hardship, you would always stand back up and face them bravely!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.810
The Yuma I know is someone like that!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:08.060
I am very brave...
...and you guys are my friends?

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.980
This little farce ends now.

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.650
I forgot you guys are here as well.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.170
Cat?!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.680
Yuma, I will seize everything from you!

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:54.740
It' useless, as long as you guys stay inside that place, he cannot hear you!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:59.030
Darn! Our voices can't reach him, and Astral isn't here either!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:02.700
Yuma...

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.670
I can't believe he would use something this despicable...

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:20.050
It'll be no good to fight <i>that</i> power all alone right now.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:39.990
Yuma! Don't forget the most important thing!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.380
What?!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.800
<i>Remember it, Yuma!</i>

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.640
<i>The thing I have taught you!</i>

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:14.480
I'll...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:24.870
I'll bring...

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:35.960
I'll bring it...

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:38.710
Yuma!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.340
Take this!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:54.900
<i>Remember it...</i>

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.780
<i>...the thing I have taught you!</i>

00:11:58.820 --> 00:11:59.530
That's right...

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.110
...the thing I have forgotten is...

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:10.290
I'll Bring it to 'Em!

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.170
Yuma's...!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.550
That's... impossible!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.970
The power of Tron's Crest was negated?!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:28.470
III!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.430
I can't believe you would use that Crest Power this far!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:35.850
Shut up! I will send you to where Astral is!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:37.860
Astral?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.150
Astral!

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.200
Where is Astral!?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.200
Unfortunately, Astral no longer exists.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.160
What do you mean?!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.960
Just as I said. Astral was eliminated.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.370
What did you say?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:12:59.590
You're lying...

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.420
You should have seen it as well...
the moment he was exterminated.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:14.600
It's a lie...

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:16.480
It's a lie!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:18.110
It's a lie!!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.190
That guy...he wouldn't leave me like this!

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.490
Hey, Kotori! Tetsuo!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.660
Kotori... how can this be!?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.750
You just can't accept it!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.290
Astral was destroyed by the power of my Crest.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.250
Astral...

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:51.010
I desire to protect my family. I will use whatever it takes to accomplish that!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.060
Now, let's continue the duel!

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:57.560
I activate the effect of the Field Magic, OOParts City Babylon!

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.730
By banishing the OOParts Monster Aztec Mask Golem from my graveyard,

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:06.070
I special summon Cabrera's Catapult with the same level from there in Defense Position!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.910
I will end my turn like this!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.160
Yuma, you only have 400 Life left.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:19.080
But I have Cabrera's Catapult and No. 33 Machu Mach on my field.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.880
You have no chance of winning!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:27.340
Alright, submit along with your 'Bring it to 'Em'!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.390
Unforgivable...

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.430
III...

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.640
...absolutely unforgivable!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.520
I'll Bring it to 'Em!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.310
Draw!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.520
<i>Think well... Yuma.</i>

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.860
<i>Now... what should you do?</i>

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.530
<i>That's right, that guy still lives within my heart!</i>

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.620
<i>Remember, remember it!</i>

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.200
<i>Every sentence he ever said!</i>

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:02.630
<i>Yuma, I will teach you the knowledge of dueling...</i>

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:05.550
<i>Huh? Why would I let you teach me?</i>

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.800
<i>Because, one day, you will have to battle alone.</i>

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.090
<i>Me, alone?</i>

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.350
<i>That's right. I have no idea when will I vanish...</i>

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:18.560
<i>But you have a future and infinite possibilities.</i>

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:22.980
<i>Thus I wish to leave behind the proof of my existence...</i>

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.070
<i>...within your memory.</i>

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.740
<i>For his sake as well, I definitely won't give up!</i>

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:34.200
<i>First is the opponent's motive, no matter what kinds of strong decks they constructed.</i>

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:38.450
<i>As long as they fall into the pace you set, they cannot dominate the duel.</i>

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:43.380
<i>III's motive is the combo of Cabrera's Catapult and Machu Mach.</i>

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.590
<i>If that connects, I would lose!</i>

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:50.220
<i>See through your opponent's motive, and stop it!</i>

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:55.720
<i>Which means I have to destroy Cabrera's Catapult or Machu Mach!</i>

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:04.230
<i>This is...
Right, is this what you left for me?</i>

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.530
<i>Then just follow your own style...</i>

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:11.900
<i>...and 'Bring it to 'Em!</i>

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.250
Here I go, Astral!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:26.840
The memory of fighting with you will become my flesh - and my blood!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.590
I activate the Equipment Magic, Gagaga Revenge!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:41.100
This card can revive a Gagaga monster in my graveyard, and equip to that monster!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.310
Revive, Gagaga Magician!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.530
Then I summon Fulelf!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.780
Once per turn, by sending one Monster from my hand to the graveyard,

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.500
Fulelf can add that monster's LV to its own!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:10.300
I send LV2 Overlay Eater to the graveyard, and increase Fulelf's LV to 4!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.470
Don't... don't tell me...

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:18.970
I overlay the LV 4 Gagaga Magician and Fulelf!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:23.730
I build the Overlay Network with these 2 monsters!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.520
Xyz summon!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:30.070
Come forth, No.39!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.530
Aspiring Emperor - Hope!!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:40.830
How is that possible?

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.910
This is the last "hope" which Astral has left to me!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.160
Hope, you say?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.830
Don't tell me you still think such a thing exists?

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.090
Sure! Of course!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:54.300
The imperishable Flame of Hope within my heart!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:58.050
That is the 'Bring it to 'Em which Astral has left to me!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.350
Yuma!!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:06.140
I activate the effect of the Equipment Magic Gagaga Revenge!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:10.020
When the equipped monster becomes a Xyz material,

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:14.480
that Xyz monster gains 300 ATK!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:20.370
Go, Aspiring Emperor - Hope, attack Machu Mach!

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.410
Hope Sword Twin Blade Shoot!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.790
Bring it to 'Em!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.460
What?!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.520
Even without Astral...what's going on here?

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.360
Here's the reason!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.020
This is the power of Astral and me!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.610
I will end my turn like this!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:00.110
Unforgivable...unforgivable, Yuma!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.740
Come at me, III!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.540
My power isn't just Machu Mach!

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.330
My turn, draw!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:17.130
I release Cabrera's Catapult to advance summon the OOParts monster Sol Monolith!

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:28.230
When Sol Monolith was successfully summoned, it can change the LV of other monsters on my field to six!

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.480
I change Mud Golem Shakouki's level to six!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:40.360
I Overlay my LV 6 Sol Monolith and Mud Golem Shakouki!

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:47.790
I build the Overlay Network with these 2 monsters!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.250
Xyz Summon!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:55.170
See for yourself. This is the new power I obtained from Tron!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.630
Come forth, Number 6!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.570
OOParts Monster...Atlantal!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.450
A new Number...

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.990
I activate Atlantal's effect!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:35.420
When this card is Xyz summoned successfully, it can equip a Number in my graveyard!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.920
You want to equip Machu Mach?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.190
Its ATK became 5000?!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:56.190
It gained Machu Mach's ATK?!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.150
Atlantal, attack Hope!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.280
Divine Punishment!!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:11.160
Dream on! I activate Hope's effect!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:13.830
Moon Barrier!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:18.420
Yes!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:22.380
It's not over yet! Atlantal's power isn't just this!

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.050
I activate Atlantal's effect!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:30.260
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it halves my opponent's LP!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.520
Orichalcum Gate!

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.320
Yuma!

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.580
This time, I will definitely give you a fatal blow!

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.290
I...I won't let you do that!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.960
I won't let you do that! I definitely won't give up!

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:08.640
That's Astral's and mine 'Bring it to 'Em'!

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:23.110
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.950
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.590
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:45.670
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.470
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.970
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:06.360
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.790
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.620
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.000
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.050
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.630
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:34.050
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.890
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.180
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:46.150
III's new Number, Atlantal, with its overwhelming power, was striking at me relentlessly.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.030
However during the midst of battle, the duel has progressed to an unexpected direction!

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.860
This is no longer AR! It's reality!!

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:54.530
If this continues...

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:57.410
I won't give up!

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:01.540
Even if Astral has vanished, he still lives inside my heart!!

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:03.750
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:06.800
"The End of a Fierce Fight! 
Hope Ray VS Atlanthal"

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:09.340
I'll bring it to 'em supersized!

00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:14.260
Today I will introduce the Monster Brass Devil Mellowmellow Melody.

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:15.850
With its effect, you can eat a melon!

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:20.980
Brass Devil Mellowmellow Melody: By detaching a Xyz-Material, it can attack once again.

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:22.270
So, where is my melon?

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:23.600
Cut it out already.

00:24:23.850 --> 00:24:24.100
Huh?
